        "@value": "ESTABLISHMENT AND APPOINTMENT OF MALAYSIA VOLUNTEERS CORPS (RELA) Establishment of Malaysia Volunteers Corps"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/21/eng@/~part_III",
